Run compiled_action host tools with the SDK scoped runtime launcher.
Origin: EmberBSD contributors (AI-assisted). Host tools link the staged
__ember1 abseil/protobuf/re2 whose install names point at the installed
native prefix; select the same scoped runtime view protoc uses.

